; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4802  ** Description    :This main function performs the task of processing all the **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4803  **                 HRH objects configured as polling and if respective        **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4804  **                 messages are received will provide notification to upper   **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4805  **                 layer. The function performs the polling of receive        **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4806  **                 indication when CanRxProcessing is set to POLLING or MIXED.**
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4807  **                 In case of MIXED processing only the hardware objects      **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4808  **                for which CanHardwareObjectUsesPolling is set to TRUE shall **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4809  **                be polled. The function is implemented as an empty define   **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4810  **                if none of the RX processing for any of the configured      **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4811  **                controllers or hardware objects (in case of mixed mode)     **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4812  **                is chosen as POLLING.In case the value of                   **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4813  **                CanMainFunctionRWPeriod is 0 or 1,                          **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4814  **                Can_17_McmCan_MainFunctionRead is used. In case it is       **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	  4815  **                greater than 1, Can_17_McmCan_MainFunctionRead_(x) is used. **
