; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13772  **                    (                                                       **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13773  **                      const uint8 HwKernelId                                **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13774  **                      const uint8 NodeIdIndex                               **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13775  **                    )                                                       **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13776  **                                                                            **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13777  ** Description    :The function shall handle receive interrupts from FIFO 0   **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13778  **                 and FIFO 1 during CAN controller STARTED state.            **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13779  **                 The ISR is triggered for FIFO0/ FIFO 1 on Watermark or     **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13780  **                 on FIFO full event. Messages are read through FIFO and     **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13781  **                 freed by acknowledging the slot to receive successive      **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13782  **                 packet. Rx FIFO interrupt processes maximum of configured  **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13783  **                 FIFO elements. In case the messages are received while the **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13784  **                 Rx FIFO messages are in progress and if number of messages **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13785  **                 received is greater than the configured threshold level;   **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13786  **                 on exit of interrupt handler; watermark interrupt will     **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13787  **                 not be triggered. Therefore all messages will be processed **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13788  **                 only on FULL interrupt.                                    **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13789  **                 If FIFO overflow is set, an error CAN_17_MCMCAN_E_DATALOST **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13790  **                 is raised to indicate that few messages may be lost.       **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13791  **                 RXFIFO 0 and 1 can be separately configured as INTERRUPT   **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13792  **                 or POLLING in case mixed mode is used.                     **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13793  ** [/cover]                                                                   **
; ..\src\BaseSw\MCAL\Can_17_McmCan\ssc\src\Can_17_McmCan.c	 13794  **                                                                            **
